# Dawnhand Dissident's "{T}, Blight 2: Exile target card from a graveyard" with its target gone before it resolves does nothing (CR
# 608.2b), though its cost was paid (CR 601.2h by way of 602.2b). Bot1 targets its Llanowar Elves in its graveyard, blighting its
# Sylvan Caryatid twice; Bot2 responds with Glorious Decay, exiling the Elves itself. The Elves are in exile but were not exiled
# with the Dissident (CR 607.2a), so with three counters among Bot1's creatures and {G} open they can't be cast from there.

